{"title":"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A cube with 3-inch edges is made using 27 cubes with 1-inch edges. Nineteen of the smaller cubes are white and eight are black. If the eight black cubes are placed at the corners of the larger cube, what fraction of the surface area of the larger cube is white? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcd0dce46e7b29f74c167aeeac5429b0f2ee5ff2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{9}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{4}{9}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{9}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{19}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"376\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The surface area of the cube is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72cbf9947a985042ffa8fc12c894527f13f23bee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(3)(3)=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />. Each of the eight black cubes has 3 faces on the outside, making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/421f2542a79b4df522f740848a979a46ccbfc83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(8)=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> black faces. Therefore there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633798fdf5e79cf8a010f3277ecb83601a4f4b7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54-24=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> white faces. To find the ratio, we evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/990b94ddfcdcbd59c8946903dd2e8c9afac9fc37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30}{54}= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{9}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"106\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nDkpGeJcTd8\">https://youtu.be/nDkpGeJcTd8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 8\">2006 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems